      "writtenOn": "2026-04-23T17:48:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are 260 submodules in Chromium. Doing submodule operations serially takes a _while_. I got a ~1100% speed improvement in rift when I parallelized submodule operations: cl/903489540\n\nThis might be a bit overly complex for this script, but given how impactful the optimization is, it might be worth considering at least.",
